 "what": "lane E demo-look: class boxes on the five den frames (godot/.shots), keyed by PNG name; python tools/style/demo_look_check.py frame <the five> --masks tools/style/demo_look_masks.json. Boxes fit the 16 Nov f2/f4 shots (her at about 960,540; boss body 740-1140 x 485-565); re-fit when a frame is re-shot. her_skin [944,506,974,527] (face, shoulders, chest) and her_hair [951,493,969,507] (the head only, inside her line) are her px only: no ground in the box (16 Nov, h3). her_shadow has no key on purpose: it measures the ground right under her feet, which must sit in the shadow band (a keyed dark box picks her boots). e3f_* (16 Nov, lead 3's dry-run shoot): copies of the f2_*/f4_boss entries, but boss_body/boss_back/boss_mane re-boxed on the probe mask (foe_den[15]=1, --env-off glow; mb2.py's split: back = h 240-340, C > .01, L > .25; mane = C > .05, h 345-60; body = the rest) as boxes inside each part (fitted at >= 93% of the keyed px in the part). bc1_a_02.png: the boss-clear frame (her clear of the Pack-Mother mid-lunge), the same three classes fitted the same way, plus the whole-frame rot_glow and fungus; its ground_lit and blood are not boxed.",
